":"Q9H4E5","text":"Plasma membrane-associated small GTPase specifically involved in angiogenesis (PubMed:21628409, PubMed:24434213, PubMed:30158707). Required for endothelial cell migration during vascular development via its interaction with GLUL (PubMed:30158707). Elicits the formation of F-actin-rich structures, thereby regulating endothelial cell migration (PubMed:30158707)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}